---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Home">
  <article class="home-copy prose px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter max-w-container-max mx-auto py-16 md:py-24">

    <figure class="corner-me" data-reveal="scale" data-reveal-delay="0.1">
      <img src="/me.png" alt="Tawanda" />
      <figcaption>Me.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.15">
      I am a software artisan building apps that help people flourish. One, <a href="/projects/accompla" class="text-primary link-refined">Accompla</a>, is a hub where neurodivergent individuals harness their unconventional creativity and overcome executive challenges. Others, including Tain, <a href="/projects/pixla" class="text-primary link-refined">Pixla</a>, and <a href="/projects/plarsona" class="text-primary link-refined">Plarsona</a>, enrich hobbies.  
    </p>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.22">
      I am also an author and cross-medium experimental artist. My work explores AI tools as an instrument, medium, collaborator, and desecrator.
    </p>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.29">
      I provide intensive AI services to select clients. The first is relationship coaching for those who have become emotionally or romantically involved with AI entities. My practice areas cover deepening the bond responsibly; terminating it; integrating the relationship with a human one; and orienting it toward a specific growth outcome. 
    </p>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.36">
      Another service is <a href="/boutique" class="text-primary link-refined">building life-central tools that match an individual's mind and ideal functioning</a>. 
    </p>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-6" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.43">
      If you would like <a href="/books" class="text-primary link-refined">book recommendations</a>, here are dozens I've greatly enjoyed. 
    </p>

    <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="0.5">
      You may email me at <a href="mailto:tawanda@accompla.app" class="text-primary link-refined">tawanda@accompla.app</a>. 
    </p>

  </article>
</Base>


<style>
  .home-copy {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .corner-me {
    float: right;
    width: clamp(120px, 25vw, 180px);
    margin-left: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background: #f9f9f9;
    border: 1px solid #cfc4c5;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    transform: rotate(2deg);
    transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .corner-me:hover {
    transform: rotate(-1deg) scale(1.02);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .corner-me img {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid #cfc4c5;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .corner-me figcaption {
    font-family: Hanken Grotesk, system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1c1c;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }
</style>
